00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:41.319
My race was, I wouldn't say completely

00:11:41.319 --> 00:11:42.960
unexpected because it was a gamble.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:47.640
I knew that I came here with the problem

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.840
in the knee and I

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:51.359
wanted to try and I did that.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:56.279
So I am happy for this. Even if, yeah,

00:11:56.279 --> 00:11:58.199
the outcome is not the one I wish for,

00:11:58.479 --> 00:12:01.079
but that's racing is part of the game, is

00:12:01.079 --> 00:12:04.680
part of competition to just show up and

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:05.880
try and get the best

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:06.960
and that's what I did.

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:09.920
But the conditions made that it was super

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:13.680
fast. We were like flying from the start

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:15.039
and I was feeling great.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:20.600
